Package: tattlr
Title: Right-Click Feedback and Bug Reports for 'shiny' Apps
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kike", "Delgado", email = "edelgado94@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("W.Y.", role = "cph", comment = "html-to-image JavaScript library, see inst/COPYRIGHTS")
  )
Description: Adds a right-click "Send feedback / Report bug" menu to any
    'shiny' app when enabled through an option or environment variable. The
    report captures the shiny context (clicked element, module namespace,
    active tabs, input values, recent input changes, outputs in error,
    console errors) and is written as a Markdown file with a reproducible
    input list. Reports can be saved to a folder, emailed, opened as 'GitHub'
    issues or 'Azure DevOps' work items, posted to 'Microsoft Teams' or
    'Slack', or passed to a custom handler. Optionally reports errors
    automatically and attaches a screenshot with typed text masked.
